          "section_id": "55322f53",
          "title": "Diffusion Models",
          "text": "Diffusion models achieve state-of-the-art performance in image and video generation. They gradually denoise random noise into structured data. While producing high-quality outputs, inference can be slow. Examples include Stable Diffusion , Imagen , DALL-E 2 and Mid- journey .",
