          "section_id": "d4536730",
          "title": "Fourier Neural Operator (FNO)",
          "text": "The Fourier Neural Operator is designed for efficiency and scalability. It operates in the fre- quency domain using Fourier transforms.\n\u2022 Resolution Invariance : Models trained on coarse grids generalize to finer grids.\n\u2022 Efficiency : Uses Fast Fourier Transforms (FFT), making it significantly faster than DeepONet for PDE problems.",
          "page_start": 2,
