    {
      "section_id": "f80aa685",
      "title": "Conclusion",
      "text": "Transformers and diffusion models dominate creative and multimodal AI tasks, while neural operators enable a new paradigm for scientific computing. DeepONet provides strong theoret- ical guarantees for operator learning, and FNO delivers scalability and resolution invariance. Together, they form the foundation of modern scientific machine learning.",
